<title>UK: Arbed unit sets 2. 0 billion Lux franc Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Arbed unit sets 2. 0 billion Lux franc Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Banque Internationale a Luxembourg,</p>
<p>Banque Generale du Luxembourg, Banque et Caisse d'Epargne de</p>
<p>l'Etat and Credit Communal/Gemeentekredit.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SIDMAR FINANCE (GROUPE ARBED SA)</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  ARBED SA  AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    22.OCT.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.625   PAY DATE    22.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
